    <rigor-hint>FULL</rigor-hint>
    <rigor-reason>Correctness-critical inbound capture: idempotent persist under Event Grid at-least-once + duplicate delivery + our own outbound echo, with dead-lettering — a dedupe error double-persists messages or drops them. BFF-touching (`.cs`, Services/Communication + Services/Jobs hot-path), serial after 030. Requires publish-size + CVE + code-review + adr-check per root §10; NFR-02 + NFR-03 are load-bearing.</rigor-reason>
    <parallel-group>W3</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>false</parallel-safe>
