  <constraints>
    <constraint source="FR-02">Complete the capture pipeline: ACS-event normalizer → `NormalizedMessage` → ingestor persists `sprk_communication`. An inbound `ChatMessageReceivedInThread` event results in exactly one persisted `sprk_communication`; the handler dead-letters to Storage on repeated failure.</constraint>
    <constraint source="FR-04">The Event Grid echo of our own outbound message is a no-op via idempotency on the ACS message id — sending once yields exactly one persisted record despite the echo.</constraint>
    <constraint source="NFR-03">Capture MUST be idempotent — dedupe on the ACS message id via the EXISTING `IIdempotencyService`. At-least-once redelivery + genuine duplicates + own-echo all collapse to one persist. MUST NOT hand-roll a dedupe store.</constraint>
    <constraint source="NFR-02">Enrichment + thread-assignment side-effects MUST be best-effort and non-fatal — a failure there MUST NOT fail the inbound-capture persist. Persist every message as `sprk_communication` (Dataverse is the record).</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-004 / ADR-036">Reuse the `Services/Jobs/` contract: `IJobHandler`, `IIdempotencyService`, `DeadLetterQueueService`, exponential-backoff retry. Dead-letter to Storage from day one; do NOT silently drop. Do NOT create a second job/DLQ mechanism.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-045">Normalize ACS→`NormalizedMessage` exactly once at the boundary (sibling to `GraphMessageNormalizer`); nothing downstream sees `Azure.Communication.*`. Persist through the `ICommunicationChannelIngestor` seam (task 021) — do NOT branch `IncomingCommunicationProcessor` on channel.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-046">ACS is transport; Dataverse is the record. Follow ADR-046 (task 007) for the echo-dedup / capture posture.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-010 / ADR-032">Register the normalizer + handler via `CommunicationModule` (unconditional; Null-Object if feature-gated). Endpoints/handlers that map unconditionally must have unconditional service registration.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Do NOT set the `sprk_thread` lookup (040 owns `IThreadResolver`); do NOT build the outbound send path (051). MUST NOT introduce a client-side ACS SDK; server-side only. ACS transport only.</constraint>
    <constraint source="root §10">bff-extensions Placement Justification in the PR; publish-size delta vs ~45.30 MB baseline; no new HIGH CVE. Run `/conflict-check` before PR (shared `Services/Communication/` + `Services/Jobs/` hot-path).</constraint>
  </constraints>

