        Map a channel-specific message to `NormalizedMessage` exactly once at the pipeline boundary. Build the ACS analog: ACS event payload → `NormalizedMessage` (direction=Incoming, from/body/sentAt/attachments, ACS thread id → `ConversationId`).
      </pattern>
